alue":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 应与 （填空） （选填“ "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" ”或“ "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ”）相连。测量时指针位置如图3所示，欧姆表的读数为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(2) 实验小组同学利用图 1 电路多次调节电阻箱阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，读出电压表对应的数据，建立 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{R} - \\frac{1}{U}"},{"type":"text","value":" 坐标系，描点连线得到如图 4 所示的图线，则该电源的电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。（结果均保留三位有效数字）\n(3) 经核实，电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的测量值与真实值一致，实验小组利用图 1 电路得到的内阻的测量值 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\text{测}}"},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）（选填“小于”、“等于”或“大于”）真实值 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\text{真}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16-I (1) C (1 分)\n(2) 0.56-0.62 (1 分) 1.0-1.1（结果均保留两位有效数字）（1 分）\n16-II (1) AC (2 分) （漏选得 1 分，错选不得分）\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"8 \\times 10^{-10}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(3) B (2 分)\n16-III （1） 黑表笔，d，4（或4.0） （3分）\n(2) 1.43, 2.25 (2分)\n(3) 小于 (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bc7ff23834a21b6605989a85ab16795ea46d499737c8c4db28ff1533bc8108d5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （8 分）如图所示为一超重报警装置示意图，长度为 L、横截面积为 S、导热性能良好的薄壁容器水平放置，开口向右。一厚度不计的轻质活塞将一定质量的理想气体封闭在容器内，活塞通过水平轻绳跨过滑轮与重物相连。不挂重物时封闭气体的长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，挂上某一质量的重物时活塞右移至位于离容器底部 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{4}L"},{"type":"text","value":" 位置的预警传感器处恰好平衡，此时系统将发出超重预警。已知环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度为 g，不计摩擦阻力。\n(1) 在挂上重物达到平衡后, 气体分子的数密度 （填空） (选填 “变大”、“变小” 或 “不变”), 器壁单位面积所受气体分子的平均作用力 （填空） (选填 “变大”、“变小” 或 “不变”);\n(2) 求刚好触发超重预警时所挂重物的质量 m;\n(3) 从刚发出预警开始, 若环境温度从 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 缓慢降至 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.99T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 该过程中气体内能减少了 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求气体向外界放出的热量 Q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/51572321f523374331db1217411ba60b1798b67af30288e02c989a8f610b3f6c.png","width":397,"height":269,"width_mm":46.55,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）\n（1）变小，变小……（2分，各1分）\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1 = p_0"},{"type":"text","value":"轻绳连接重物刚好触发超重预警时，设理想气体的压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2S + mg = p_0S"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n对理想气体，由玻意耳定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"p _ {1} \\cdot \\frac {1}{4} L S = p _ {2} \\cdot \\frac {3}{4} L S \\dots"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"m=\\frac{2p_{0}S}{3g}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n（3）由盖-吕萨克定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{2}}{T_{0}}=\\frac{V_{3}}{0.99T_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{3}=0.99V_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n此过程外界对气体做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W = p_{2}\\Delta V = p_{2}(V_{2} - V_{3})"},{"type":"text","value":"由以上两式可得"},{"type":"math","value":"W = 0.01p_{2}V_{2} = 0.01p_{1}V_{1} = \\frac{p_{0}SL}{400}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n由热力学第一定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\Delta U = -Q + W"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\Delta U + \\frac{p_{0}SL}{400}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e24486e3b71e83c5cf3a49b3f084ca06f22e30ae63f6e827fd6ad32795e6be76","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）如图所示，某固定装置由长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 3\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的倾斜传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆心角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha = 23^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的两圆弧管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成，轨道间平滑连接。在轨道末端 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 的右侧的光滑水平面上紧靠着轻质小车，小车上表面与 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 所在的水平面平齐，右端放置质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2} = 3\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 。一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1} = 1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 从传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点由静止释放，经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 滑出圆弧管道。已知传送带由电动机带动，以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = 8\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针转动， "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 与传送带及小车间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1} = 1.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 与小车间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其它轨道均光滑，物块均可视为质点，不计空气阻力， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 在传送带上运动的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" ；  \n（2）为维持传送带能匀速运送物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 从 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点到 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，求电动机多做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W"},{"type":"text","value":" ；  \n（3）求物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时对管道的作用力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；  \n（4）要使物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 恰好不与物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 发生碰撞，求小车长度的最小值 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ed27ad0a3b8677f012c95e3bf578a26555fca22325c4bb95103098fab6242503.png","width":892,"height":444,"width_mm":104.828,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (11 分)\n（1）对物块"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"分析有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}m_{1}g\\cos 37^{\\circ} - m_{1}g\\sin 37^{\\circ} = m_{1}a_{1}"},{"type":"math","value":"a_1 = 6\\mathrm{m / s}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）设小物块一直加速到传送到上端时，其速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，有"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}^{2} = 2a_{1}L"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 6\\mathrm{m / s} < 8\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = a_{1}t"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 1s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) 设传送带的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{传}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{传}} = vt = 8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"物块"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"相对传送带的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = x_{\\text{传}} - L = 5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n摩擦产生的热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\mu_1 m_1 g \\cos 37^\\circ \\cdot \\Delta x = 60\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"电动机多做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W = \\frac{1}{2} m_1 v_1^2 + m_1 g L \\sin 37^\\circ + Q, \\quad W = 96\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"……(2分)\n（3）由题意可知圆弧轨道光滑，所以从 B 到 D，由动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"-m_{1}g(R\\cos37^{\\circ}-R\\cos60^{\\circ}+\\frac{R}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{D}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}=2\\sqrt{5}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (2分)\n在 D 点有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N\\text{支}} + m_{1}g = m_{1}\\frac{v_{D}^{2}}{R}, \\quad F_{N\\text{支}} = 10N"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n由牛顿第三定律可知，物块 a 对管道的作用力等于管道对物块 a 的支持力，所以物块 a 到达 D 点时对管道的作用力为 10N，方向竖直向上。\n（4）当物块滑上小车后，由于"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}m_{1}g = 15\\mathrm{N} > \\mu_{2}m_{2}g = 6\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以小车与物块"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"保持相对静止，而物块"},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":"相对于小车发生滑动。……（1分）当两者速度相同时，为物块"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"与物块"},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":"相碰的临界状态，其运动示意图如图所示"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/375a2f50062e82d82246ae1df40248c77ae6ca58d811b34133cfef50efe87ba5.png","width":517,"height":87,"width_mm":65.5},{"type":"text","value":"该过程由动量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}v_{D} = (m_{1} + m_{2})v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"能量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} m_1v_D^2 = \\frac{1}{2}(m_1 + m_2)v_{\\text{共}}^2 +\\mu_2m_2gd"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"d = \\frac{5}{4}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"fc4a9a93ba0af47204e5ae7a722727194e8aab1b3b3209408150bdccdaa6c95f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）某物理兴趣小组设计了一个电流天平，如图所示，“山”形磁铁的两侧为N极，中心为S极，两极间的磁感应强度大小均为B，磁极宽度均为L，忽略边缘效应。绕在骨架上的正方形线圈套于中心磁极，骨架与秤盘连为一体，线圈两端C、D与外电路连接。当一待测重物放在秤盘上时，弹簧被压缩，秤盘和线圈一起向下运动（骨架与磁极不接触），随后外电路对线圈供电，使秤盘和线圈恢复到未放重物时的位置并静止，由此时对应的供电电流可确定重物的质量。已知线圈匝数为n，电阻为R，弹簧劲度系数为k，秤盘和线圈（含骨架）的总质量为M，空气阻力忽略不计，求：（1）线圈向下运动过程中，线圈C端的电势高还是D端的高？\n（2）若供电的电流为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则待测重物的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 是多大？\n（3）如果把供电电源撤去、重物取走，将线圈 C、D 两端短接，待秤盘静止后，再将质量也为 M 的重物轻轻置于秤盘上，秤盘会做阻尼振动，\n①从把质量为 M 的重物轻轻放置到秤盘上到最终秤盘停止运动，该过程中线圈产生的焦耳热；（已知弹簧的弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=\\frac{1}{2}kx^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，k 为弹簧的劲度系数，x 为弹簧的形变量）\n②从把质量为 M 的重物轻轻放置到秤盘上到秤盘第一次运动到最低点时弹簧的形变量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求该过程中线圈受到的安培力的冲量大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a8aeb1ba302c9cfea9e51024cbbdadccf9c0fd1ef525e2d645c6a56441f6e6b5.png","width":337,"height":239,"width_mm":39.558,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第19题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. (11 分)\n(1) C 端 ..... (2 分)\n（2）由平衡条件得"},{"type":"math","value":"mg = 2nBIL"},{"type":"text","value":"……（2分）得"},{"type":"math","value":"m = \\frac{2nBIL}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n（3）①没放重物时，弹簧的压缩量"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1} = \\frac{Mg}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"最终静止时，弹簧的压缩量"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2} = \\frac{2Mg}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）由能量守恒定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"2Mg(x_{2} - x_{1}) = Q + \\frac{1}{2} kx_{2}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2} kx_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\frac{M^2g^2}{2k}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②安培力的冲量大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\text{安}} = \\overline {{F _ {\\text{安}}}} \\cdot \\Delta t = 2 n B \\bar {I} \\cdot L \\cdot \\Delta t = \\frac {4 n ^ {2} B ^ {2} L ^ {2} \\bar {v}}{R} \\cdot \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\bar {v} \\cdot \\Delta t = x _ {0} - \\frac {M g}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"联立以上各式得"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\text{安}} = \\frac {4 n ^ {2} B ^ {2} L ^ {2} (x _ {0} - \\frac {M g}{k})}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bbb531ac282554743fbff37ed87b9cab21076863897a0fdd2cdff3a806079a23","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. （11 分）物理学家在科研时经常利用电磁场加速和约束高能粒子。在如图所示的空间直角坐标系 Oxyz 中， "},{"type":"math","value":"x \\ge 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 的空间内充满匀强磁场，大小为 B，方向可调，初始时沿 x 轴负方向。坐标为 "},{"type":"math","value":"(0, 0, L)"},{"type":"text","value":" 的 M 点有一粒子源，可沿 yOz 平面内的第一象限与 z 轴负方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 角发射粒子。粒子第一次运动到 xOy 平面时轨迹恰好与 y 轴相切。已知粒子质量为 m，电荷量为 +q，不计粒子重力和粒子间的相互作用。\n（1）求粒子初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小。\n（2）将磁场方向调整为沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向，求 ① 粒子运动到 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面的时间； ② 粒子经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面时的 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 坐标与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 坐标的表达式。（可用三角函数表示）\n（3）保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"x \\ge 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 空间的初始磁场和粒子发射方向不变，在此空间再充满沿 z 轴负方向的匀强电场，电场强度大小满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0} = \\frac{v_{0} B}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求粒子运动过程中距 xOy 平面的最大距离 d。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/18812bd4ea3d77291fbfbaf0aef5910b292266c0248e1b2aeaf49aedc36fde28.png","width":363,"height":412,"width_mm":42.673,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2411-q20-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）\n（1）由洛伦兹力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{0}B=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n由几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"r-L=r\\sin30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{2qBL}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n(2) ①粒子做螺旋运动, 可分解为沿"},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":"轴负方向的匀速直线运动和沿"},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":"平面的匀速圆周运动, 设到"},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":"平面的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":", 做匀速圆周运动的半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_1"},{"type":"text","value":", 周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":", 则粒子运动到"},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":"平面的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{L}{v_0 \\cos 30^\\circ} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3} m}{3qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"q(v_0 \\sin 30^\\circ) B = \\frac{m(v_0 \\sin 30^\\circ)^2}{r_1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi r_1}{v_0 \\sin 30^\\circ} = \\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"x = r_1 - r_1 \\cos \\frac{2\\pi}{T} t = L \\left(1 - \\cos \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"y = r_1 \\sin \\frac{2\\pi}{T} t = L \\sin \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（3）由已知条件"},{"type":"math","value":"E_0 = \\frac{v_0B}{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"qE_0 = q\\frac{v_0}{2} B"},{"type":"text","value":"\n将初速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"分解为如图所示的"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，令"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = \\frac{v_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c90072820bf1a32e91d5ddacde951c0ae99cb5b94b2aab4309508ecc66ba8d38.png","width":250,"height":245,"width_mm":31.6},{"type":"text","value":"由平行四边形定则得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n粒子的运动可以看成是"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速直线运动和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速圆周运动两种运动的合成，设匀速圆周运动半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{2}B = m\\frac{v_{2}^{2}}{r_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2} = \\sqrt{3}L"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n由几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"d = L + r_{2} = (1 + \\sqrt{3})L"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"}]}}]}
